The '''Figure Skating Cats''' are a [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rare Cat]] that were added in [[Version 3.0 Update|Version 3.0]] and can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]]. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 7.1 Update|Version 7.1]] increases health and attack power and gains [[Strong Against|Strong]] against [[:Category:Relic Enemies|Relics]] and [[Immune to Curse|Curse Immunity]]. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 10.2 Update|Version 10.2]].

